msgid "Explorer default prompts"
msgstr "Vidokezo chaguomsingi vya Vigunduzi"

msgid "Customize the example prompts shown when Grok is selected in compatible Drupal AI Explorers. Existing user input is never replaced. Leave a prompt blank to disable its default."
msgstr "Geuza kukufaa vidokezo vya mfano vinavyoonyeshwa Grok inapochaguliwa katika Vigunduzi vinavyooana vya Drupal AI. Ingizo lililopo la mtumiaji halibadilishwi kamwe. Acha kidokezo wazi ili kuzima chaguomsingi lake."

msgid "Chat prompt"
msgstr "Kidokezo cha gumzo"

msgid "Image-to-image prompt"
msgstr "Kidokezo cha picha hadi picha"

msgid "Text-to-video prompt"
msgstr "Kidokezo cha maandishi hadi video"

msgid "Moderation prompt"
msgstr "Kidokezo cha usimamizi"

msgid "Text-to-image prompt"
msgstr "Kidokezo cha maandishi hadi picha"

msgid "Text-to-speech prompt"
msgstr "Kidokezo cha maandishi hadi usemi"

msgid "Image source"
msgstr "Chanzo cha picha"

msgid "Upload an image"
msgstr "Pakia picha"

msgid "Use Drupal Media"
msgstr "Tumia Media ya Drupal"

msgid "Use default media"
msgstr "Tumia media chaguomsingi"

msgid "Upload a JPG, JPEG, PNG, or WebP image."
msgstr "Pakia picha ya JPG, JPEG, PNG au WebP."

msgid "Default Explorer image"
msgstr "Picha chaguomsingi ya Kigunduzi"

msgid "Drupal Media image"
msgstr "Picha ya Media ya Drupal"

msgid "Select an existing image from Drupal Media."
msgstr "Chagua picha iliyopo kutoka Media ya Drupal."

msgid "Grok xAi Provider"
msgstr "Mtoa huduma wa Grok xAi"

msgid "Grok AI Provider"
msgstr "Mtoa huduma wa AI wa Grok"

msgid "Unofficial"
msgstr "Isiyo rasmi"

msgid "Text to Video"
msgstr "Maandishi kuwa video"

msgid "Generate a short video from a text prompt."
msgstr "Tengeneza video fupi kutoka maelezo ya maandishi."

msgid "Text-To-Video Generation Explorer"
msgstr "Kichunguzi cha Utengenezaji wa Video kutoka Maandishi"

msgid "Experiment with Grok text-to-video generation."
msgstr "Jaribu utengenezaji wa video kutoka maandishi kwa Grok."

msgid "Describe the video to generate."
msgstr "Eleza video ya kutengenezwa."

msgid "Generate a Video"
msgstr "Tengeneza Video"

msgid "Video generation failed"
msgstr "Utengenezaji wa video umeshindikana"

msgid "Video duration"
msgstr "Muda wa video"

msgid "These settings permit tools at site level. Individual requests must still select a permitted tool. Hosted tools can incur additional xAI charges."
msgstr "Mipangilio hii inaruhusu zana katika kiwango cha tovuti. Kila ombi lazima lichague zana iliyoruhusiwa. Zana zinazopangishwa zinaweza kuwa na gharama za ziada za xAI."
msgid "Allows Grok to search and browse the public web for current information. Requests can optionally restrict searches to allowed or excluded domains and enable image search or image understanding. xAI charges separately for hosted search calls."
msgstr "Inaruhusu Grok kutafuta taarifa za sasa kwenye wavuti ya umma. Maombi yanaweza kuweka mipaka ya vikoa na kuwezesha utafutaji au uelewa wa picha. xAI hutoza utafutaji huu kando."
msgid "Allows Grok to search public posts, users, and threads on X. Individual requests can restrict handles and dates or enable image and video understanding. xAI charges separately for hosted search calls."
msgstr "Inaruhusu Grok kutafuta machapisho, watumiaji na mijadala ya umma kwenye X. Maombi yanaweza kuweka mipaka ya akaunti na tarehe au kuwezesha uelewa wa picha na video."
msgid "Allows Grok to write and execute Python in an isolated environment managed by xAI. It is useful for calculations and data analysis. The environment has no access to this Drupal site unless data is included in the prompt, and tool calls may incur additional charges."
msgstr "Inaruhusu Grok kuandika na kutekeleza Python katika mazingira yaliyotengwa ya xAI kwa hesabu na uchanganuzi wa data. Mazingira hayafikii tovuti hii bila data kwenye ombi, na gharama za ziada zinaweza kutokea."
msgid "Allows Grok to search xAI collections containing previously uploaded documents. Individual requests must provide permitted collection IDs. Collection storage, retrieval, and search can incur additional xAI charges."
msgstr "Inaruhusu Grok kutafuta makusanyo ya xAI yenye nyaraka zilizopakiwa. Maombi lazima yatoe vitambulisho vilivyoruhusiwa. Uhifadhi, urejeshaji na utafutaji unaweza kuwa na gharama za ziada."
msgid "Allows xAI to connect Grok to explicitly allowlisted remote MCP servers. Each server must use HTTPS and expose only the tool names listed below. Enable this only for trusted servers because MCP tools may read or modify external systems."
msgstr "Inaruhusu xAI kuunganisha Grok na seva za mbali za MCP zilizoruhusiwa. Kila seva itumie HTTPS na ionyeshe zana zilizoorodheshwa tu. Washa kwa seva zinazoaminika pekee."
msgid "After saving a working xAI API key and default Grok model, connect Grok to the Drupal AI features that should use it:"
msgstr "Baada ya kuhifadhi ufunguo halali wa xAI API na modeli chaguomsingi ya Grok, unganisha Grok na vipengele vya Drupal AI vinavyopaswa kuitumia:"
msgid "Use <strong>Test connection and load models</strong>, select the Grok model you want this provider to use by default, and save this form."
msgstr "Tumia <strong>Jaribu muunganisho na upakie modeli</strong>, chagua modeli chaguomsingi ya Grok, kisha hifadhi fomu."
msgid "Open <a href=\":url\">Default Models for AI Operations</a> and select <strong>Grok (xAI)</strong> for Chat, Text To Image, and Text To Video. Choose the appropriate Grok chat and Grok Imagine models for features that rely on site-wide defaults."
msgstr "Fungua <a href=\":url\">Modeli Chaguomsingi za Operesheni za AI</a> na uchague <strong>Grok (xAI)</strong> kwa Gumzo, Maandishi kuwa Picha na Maandishi kuwa Video."
msgid "Review each Drupal AI module or feature you enable. Configure it to use the site-wide Chat default, or select Grok explicitly when that feature provides its own provider and model settings."
msgstr "Kagua kila moduli au kipengele cha Drupal AI. Tumia chaguomsingi la Chat la tovuti au uchague Grok waziwazi panapokuwa na mipangilio yake."
msgid "Grok supports Chat-based text, vision, function tools, structured output, text-to-image generation, and text-to-video generation. Operations such as embeddings and speech require another provider that supports those operation types."
msgstr "Grok inasaidia maandishi ya Chat, kuona, zana za vitendaji, matokeo yaliyopangwa na utengenezaji wa picha na video kutoka maandishi. Embeddings na sauti zinahitaji mtoa huduma mwingine."
msgid "To use xAI-hosted tools, permit them in <strong>Hosted tool permissions</strong>, then enable the permitted tools in the individual model or request configuration that needs them."
msgstr "Kutumia zana za xAI, ziruhusu katika <strong>Ruhusa za zana zinazopangishwa</strong>, kisha ziwashe katika mipangilio ya modeli au ombi husika."

msgid "Provides Grok models from xAI to the Drupal AI modules."
msgstr "Hutoa modeli za Grok kutoka xAI kwa moduli za AI za Drupal."

msgid "AI Providers"
msgstr "Watoa huduma wa AI"

msgid "Grok authentication"
msgstr "Uthibitishaji wa Grok"

msgid "Configure access to the xAI API."
msgstr "Sanidi ufikiaji wa API ya xAI."

msgid "Configure Grok authentication, models, transports, and hosted tools."
msgstr "Sanidi uthibitishaji, modeli, njia za usafirishaji na zana zinazopangishwa za Grok."

msgid "Configure Grok Integrations"
msgstr "Sanidi miunganisho ya Grok"

msgid "xAI API key"
msgstr "Ufunguo wa API ya xAI"

msgid "Select a Key containing an API key created in the xAI Console."
msgstr "Chagua ufunguo ulio na ufunguo wa API ulioundwa kwenye dashibodi ya xAI."

msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya kina"

msgid "API base URL"
msgstr "URL msingi ya API"

msgid "Transport"
msgstr "Usafirishaji"

msgid "Automatic (recommended)"
msgstr "Otomatiki (inapendekezwa)"

msgid "Chat Completions only"
msgstr "Chat Completions pekee"

msgid "Responses API for compatible requests"
msgstr "API ya Responses kwa maombi yanayooana"

msgid "Allow xAI to store Responses API requests"
msgstr "Ruhusu xAI kuhifadhi maombi ya API ya Responses"

msgid "Responses request timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa mwisho wa ombi la Responses"

msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "Jaribu muunganisho"

msgid "Test connection and load models"
msgstr "Jaribu muunganisho na upakie modeli"

msgid "Default Grok model"
msgstr "Modeli chaguo-msingi ya Grok"

msgid "Hosted tool permissions"
msgstr "Ruhusa za zana zinazopangishwa"

msgid "Permit Web Search"
msgstr "Ruhusu Utafutaji wa Wavuti"

msgid "Permit X Search"
msgstr "Ruhusu Utafutaji wa X"

msgid "Permit Code Interpreter"
msgstr "Ruhusu Mkalimani wa Msimbo"

msgid "Permit Collections Search"
msgstr "Ruhusu Utafutaji wa Mikusanyiko"

msgid "Permit allowlisted remote MCP servers"
msgstr "Ruhusu seva za mbali za MCP zilizoidhinishwa"

msgid "Remote MCP server allowlist"
msgstr "Orodha ya seva za mbali za MCP zilizoidhinishwa"

msgid "About"
msgstr "Kuhusu"

msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "Hatua Zinazofuata"

msgid "Try the configured models in the <a href=\":chat_url\">Chat Generation Explorer</a>, <a href=\":image_url\">Text-To-Image Generation Explorer</a>, and <a href=\":video_url\">Text-To-Video Generation Explorer</a>."
msgstr "Jaribu modeli zilizosanidiwa katika <a href=\":chat_url\">Kichunguzi cha Utengenezaji wa Gumzo</a>, <a href=\":image_url\">Kichunguzi cha Utengenezaji wa Picha kutoka Maandishi</a>, na <a href=\":video_url\">Kichunguzi cha Utengenezaji wa Video kutoka Maandishi</a>."

msgid "To use Grok in CKEditor, enable the <strong>AI CKEditor integration</strong> module, then open <a href=\":url\">Text formats and editors</a>. Edit each CKEditor 5 text format that needs AI, add the AI button to its active toolbar, enable the required AI actions, and select <strong>Grok (xAI)</strong> with a Grok chat model for each action, or verify that the action uses the site-wide Chat default. Also grant the appropriate roles the <em>use ai ckeditor</em> permission."
msgstr "Ili kutumia Grok katika CKEditor, washa moduli ya <strong>Ujumuishaji wa AI CKEditor</strong>, kisha fungua <a href=\":url\">Miundo ya maandishi na vihariri</a>. Hariri kila muundo wa maandishi wa CKEditor 5 unaohitaji AI, ongeza kitufe cha AI kwenye upau wake wa zana unaotumika, washa vitendo vya AI vinavyohitajika, na uchague <strong>Grok (xAI)</strong> pamoja na modeli ya gumzo ya Grok kwa kila kitendo, au hakikisha kuwa kitendo kinatumia chaguo-msingi la Chat la tovuti nzima. Pia zipe dhima zinazofaa ruhusa ya <em>use ai ckeditor</em>."

msgid "Number of images"
msgstr "Idadi ya picha"

msgid "Aspect ratio"
msgstr "Uwiano wa vipimo"

msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "Mwonekano"

msgid "Request transparent background"
msgstr "Omba mandharinyuma yenye uwazi"

msgid "Version: @version"
msgstr "Toleo: @version"

msgid "seconds"
msgstr "sekunde"

msgid "The selected Key does not contain an API key."
msgstr "Ufunguo uliochaguliwa hauna ufunguo wa API."

msgid "Could not authenticate with xAI: @message"
msgstr "Imeshindikana kuthibitisha na xAI: @message"

msgid "Connection failed: @message"
msgstr "Muunganisho umeshindikana: @message"

msgid "xAI did not return any accessible Grok models for this key."
msgstr "xAI haikurejesha modeli zozote za Grok zinazoweza kufikiwa kwa ufunguo huu."
msgid "An image editing prompt is required."
msgstr "Maagizo ya kuhariri picha yanahitajika."

msgid "Upload the source image you want Grok to edit."
msgstr "Pakia picha chanzo unayotaka Grok ihariri."

msgid "Describe the requested changes in the prompt below. Image editing can take time to complete and each request may count against your xAI API usage."
msgstr "Eleza mabadiliko unayotaka katika maagizo yaliyo hapa chini. Uhariri wa picha unaweza kuchukua muda na kila ombi linaweza kuhesabiwa katika matumizi yako ya API ya xAI."

msgid "Prompt"
msgstr "Maagizo"

msgid "Describe how Grok should change the source image."
msgstr "Eleza jinsi Grok inavyopaswa kubadilisha picha chanzo."

msgid "Text content to assess for potentially harmful material."
msgstr "Maudhui ya maandishi ya kutathmini kama yana nyenzo zinazoweza kudhuru."

msgid "An image and optional candidate labels to classify."
msgstr "Picha na lebo teule za hiari za kuainisha."

msgid "Maximum labels"
msgstr "Idadi ya juu ya lebo"

msgid "Maximum number of labels Grok may return when candidate labels are not supplied."
msgstr "Idadi ya juu ya lebo ambazo Grok inaweza kurudisha wakati lebo teule hazijatolewa."

msgid "Configure Grok as the default for Image Classification and Moderation, then test it in the <a href=\":classification_url\">Image Classification Explorer</a> and <a href=\":moderation_url\">Moderation Explorer</a>. Moderation is a model-based assessment, not a dedicated xAI safety endpoint."
msgstr "Sanidi Grok kuwa chaguo-msingi kwa Uainishaji wa Picha na Udhibiti, kisha ijaribu katika <a href=\":classification_url\">Kichunguzi cha Uainishaji wa Picha</a> na <a href=\":moderation_url\">Kichunguzi cha Udhibiti</a>. Udhibiti ni tathmini inayotegemea modeli, si kituo maalumu cha usalama cha xAI."

msgid "Select an xAI voice for Text To Speech and xAI Speech to Text for Speech To Text, then test them in the <a href=\":tts_url\">Text-To-Speech Explorer</a> and <a href=\":stt_url\">Speech-To-Text Explorer</a>."
msgstr "Chagua sauti ya xAI kwa Maandishi kwenda Sauti na xAI Speech to Text kwa Sauti kwenda Maandishi, kisha zijaribu katika <a href=\":tts_url\">Kichunguzi cha Maandishi kwenda Sauti</a> na <a href=\":stt_url\">Kichunguzi cha Sauti kwenda Maandishi</a>."

msgid "Grok supports Chat-based text, vision, function tools, structured output, text-to-image generation, image-to-image editing, image-to-video generation, text-to-video generation, text-to-speech, and speech-to-text. Operations such as embeddings require another provider that supports those operation types."
msgstr "Grok inasaidia maandishi ya mazungumzo, uoni, zana za vitendaji, matokeo yaliyopangwa, maandishi kwenda picha, picha kwenda picha, picha kwenda video, maandishi kwenda video, maandishi kwenda sauti na sauti kwenda maandishi. Operesheni kama embeddings zinahitaji mtoa huduma mwingine anayezisaidia."

